        "@value": "[RDF IRI](https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-concepts/#section-IRIs) An additional SPDX spec version 2 RDF IRI by which the element may be know. This is for reference only, and cannot be used to link elements together in SPDX spec version 3."
      }
    ],
